  <h1>Privacy</h1>
  <p>
    Subtitle Kit tools run entirely in your web browser using JavaScript. Subtitle and
    script content you paste is not transmitted to our servers because we do not operate
    backend processing for these tools.
  </p>
  <p>
    When you deploy this site, the hosting provider (e.g. Cloudflare Pages) may log
    standard HTTP requests (IP, user agent) for security and delivery. Third-party ads or
    analytics, if enabled later, are governed by those providers' policies.
  </p>
  <p>Last updated: 2026-09-20</p>
</BaseLayout>
